{
  "_comment": [
    "Every generated colour file. apply-theme.py renders each template with the",
    "chosen palette and writes it to the target path.",
    "",
    "Path variables: $CONFIG $DATA $STATE $HOME $REPO",
    "",
    "'group' decides which running application gets reloaded after a change,",
    "so switching flavour does not require logging out."
  ],
  "files": [
    {
      "template": "hypr-theme.lua.tmpl",
      "target": "$CONFIG/hypr/theme.lua",
      "group": "hypr"
    },
    {
      "template": "hyprlock.conf.tmpl",
      "target": "$CONFIG/hypr/hyprlock.conf",
      "group": "hypr"
    },
    {
